{"3264250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knights of the Apocalypse", "steam_appid": 3264250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an epic adventure with this medieval hack-and-slash action RPG that blends apocalyptic chaos with nostalgic retro style. Set in a dark and devastated world, the game challenges players to explore perilous lands, face brutal enemy hordes, and enhance their skills to survive every encounter. With intense gameplay and modern graphics that pay homage to classic pixel art, this game revives the magic of legendary RPGs while innovating with dynamic, captivating mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive, Apocalyptic World:</strong> Journey through devastated, intriguing landscapes filled with secrets, challenges, and terrifying creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Hack-and-Slash Combat:</strong> Battle against hordes of enemies in visceral fights that require precision and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:</strong> Upgrade skills, customize your character, and make choices that directly impact your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Modern Graphic Style:</strong> Visuals inspired by classic pixel art with a modern twist, delivering nostalgia with updated graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich, Challenging Gameplay:</strong> Innovative mechanics that offer an engaging, unique experience in every game session.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is crafted for both RPG veterans and new players seeking the best of both worlds: the charm of classic games with the sophistication of modern technology.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an epic adventure with this medieval hack-and-slash action RPG th